Third-party notice
------------------

OmniReel is an independent implementation. Its architecture was informed by
studying the following public projects. No source code was copied from them.

* lcy362/agnes-video-generator (MIT) - single-provider multi-scene pipeline
  and checkpoint/resume ideas.
* OpenMontageInc/OpenMontage (AGPL-3.0) - provider scoring dimensions and
  production quality-gate concepts. AGPL code is deliberately NOT reused so
  that OmniReel can stay MIT.

The provider APIs integrated here are governed by their own terms of service.
OmniReel does not grant any right to those services.
